ts=2026-07-02T12:00:00Z level=info msg="Sesiune optimizare lag generare chunk-uri BalloonWar"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:01Z level=info msg="Bug 1: Thread-ul (_generate_chunk_worker) nu tinea cont de overrides la generare mesh -> sapatul la suprafata nu functiona. Fix: overrides.duplicate() pasat in worker, _thread_adjust_height() ajusteaza inaltimea"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:02Z level=info msg="Bug 2: Coliziune blocuri modificate n-avea grup 'Digable' -> nu puteau fi sapate cu physics raycast. Fix: body.add_to_group('Digable') in _add_visible_block()"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:03Z level=info msg="Bug 3: _pending_post_sync.has(key) nu functiona pe array de dict-uri -> acelasi chunk adaugat de 2-3 ori, root freed -> crash. Fix: _pending_post_sync_keys dict separat"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:04Z level=info msg="Bug 4: generation_completed_chunks incrementat si la lansare worker si la finalizare -> dublu. Fix: sters incrementul din _process_chunk_queue"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:05Z level=info msg="Bug 5: water.render_priority pe MeshInstance3D -> proprietate invalida. Fix: stearsa linia"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:06Z level=info msg="Bug 6: HeightMapShape3D body la (0,0,0) pentru toate chunk-urile -> coliziune corecta doar la chunk-ul (0,0). Fix: body.position = Vector3(cx * chunk_dimensions, 0, cz * chunk_dimensions)"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:07Z level=info msg="Stare curenta: cod inca are threading (+pending_post_sync, +generation_tasks, +mutex) desi promptul cerea simplificare. MAX_THREADS=1, lod_enabled=false, mobile_mode=true, distanta_randare=2, cave_enabled=false"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:08Z level=info msg="Probleme ramase: loading screen inca lent (threading + post_sync + cozi = overhead mare). Sugestie: rescrie generarea pe main thread cu time budget, fara thread-uri."
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:09Z level=info msg="Path principal: /home/teodor/Desktop/BalloonWar/teren_proceduaral.gd (2409 linii)"
ts=2026-07-02T12:00:10Z level=info msg="Prompturi create: prompt_lag_chunks.txt, prompt_lag_chunks_v2.txt, prompt_crash_fix.txt, prompt_fix_crash_37.txt, prompt_mobile_final.txt, prompt_simplify_final.txt"
